msgid ""
"No telemetry, no ads, no account. These two connect to the internet without "
"being asked each time, and send only what is written under them."
msgstr ""
"Tiada telemetri, tiada iklan, tiada akaun. Dua pilihan ini menyambung ke "
"internet tanpa bertanya setiap kali, dan hanya menghantar apa yang tertulis "
"di bawahnya."

